  "attribution": "來源：《焦氏易林》，易學網《焦氏易林［四庫全書版］》（依據版本：《欽定四庫全書》子部術數類），https://www.eee-learning.com/book/giauii 。依來源要求標示出處及原網頁連結；本站僅整理林辭原文，並記錄收錄、標點及文字整理修改。",
  "entryCount": 64,
  "missingTargets": [],
  "entries": [
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 25,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 25,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 25,
      "hexagramName": "无妄",
      "poemText": "夏臺羑里，湯文厄處。皋陶聽斷，岐人悅喜。西望華首，東歸無咎。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8409d45609720343a03644e2cf3803420c87d2db2d4dca758dd7f6e83b973986",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b8a31d60bb8c9c2e653487bf686657bff507b02b7a2375069249280164efee06"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 1,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 1,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 1,
      "hexagramName": "乾",
      "poemText": "儋耳穿胸，纏離勞舂。天地易紀，日月更始。蝮螫我手，痛為吾毒。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e487f8ad1e971e380d76390391c5bfd93bac9c860186fab5c8405da73e31fa4a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1d09b4e344e50c6ee19b185538f9b42ee48eac193d0a025515fe7afac13d2f95"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 2,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 2,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 2,
      "hexagramName": "坤",
      "poemText": "慈母之恩，長大無孫。消息褓襁，害不入門。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9382cd3d0eec16d7ce70a221a76348fd3cea46043588a6082ca8680e71f4ba7f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:dc119dd4ac21bc81af836b086f1e3962f6176fd82e29abc30a1e6f5bcdbe5bd8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 3,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 3,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 3,
      "hexagramName": "屯",
      "poemText": "言妄語，轉相詿誤。道左失跡，不知郎處。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1e661902b4b10c0da81fa4ed673b11b179e1b8a65766a4bc801ce71bc2d11391",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2d79a459e638d863a64cf46100896fee1515c25bc4719f3a9bef0afcffa57768"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 4,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 4,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 4,
      "hexagramName": "蒙",
      "poemText": "鬱映不明，陰積無光。日在北陸，萬物彫藏。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8b43341a95520c1616d724d9b686139f8db8a4b55902547ef2221b57f22d8393",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b5e01621275acbc2c8bbfd584d6352c74d7bbc8f0fb94162bbf312e9fa76909e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 5,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 5,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 5,
      "hexagramName": "需",
      "poemText": "主母多福，天祿所伏。居之寵昌，君子有光。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7a088f3a112fee3154ee38aab0b93b628b6d3c61b4e8885aa7082db327875c63",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:275e6f63392a59159105da7e84c7ea449e92c4100c5f962cf278c3b5f15481fe"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 6,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 6,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 6,
      "hexagramName": "訟",
      "poemText": "不耕而獲，家食不給。中女無良，長子跛足。疏齒善市，商人有喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9f7e5ce522919af29b429af09a72b0002f67bdd2b69e7757eeb6eff3b27bf3f8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3595eff4fb148dcea4098784c3043af27e13956011699daa9d86aae0916c48f7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 7,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 7,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 7,
      "hexagramName": "師",
      "poemText": "火起上門，不為我殘。跳脫東西，獨得生完。不利山鄰，病疾憂患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f4b1096e2195a02b60ba80af1b2c8aaac8d72cd12ca68513ba4d9b38d81f4fd1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4b6f395723ebfb6665c1da6975d2ed26e84a67b77aec2925e00c2ab8184a425a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 8,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 8,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 8,
      "hexagramName": "比",
      "poemText": "持刃操肉，對酒不食。夫亡從軍，少子入獄。抱膝獨宿。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ec90a703594d510447dca7fee3eb3f387f5f17d8b84a71e8a436dc36896781b9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b4f925e81df9c65f660d92fc4abd2282ecd72c774f9709e4589cb90e1fe176fb"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 9,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 9,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 9,
      "hexagramName": "小畜",
      "poemText": "蝦去海，遊於枯里。街巷迫狹，不得自在。南北四極，渴餒成疾。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f3fee7f29c263de7217abac7c5a81fce3485d5d2d529bcf1641d038297899ee2",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:614c714efcf556ba3fc2f99f19bcf89c92646b1c869edd64b17e64335a16a25a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 10,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 10,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 10,
      "hexagramName": "履",
      "poemText": "啞啞笑語，與歡飲酒。長樂行觴，千秋起舞。拜受大福。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9f4afd3d77a6eaa063d5f2e60f2bf47d76f9cec24b2fd29de3f8373871539522",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1ba8acf365d094d82fcb9ff723d2ede5d9873234ccb37dcfaf4bca1d77672651"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 11,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 11,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 11,
      "hexagramName": "泰",
      "poemText": "登高上山，賓於四門。士伍得懽，福為我根。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:babe809f6381004551e309daa4eb68d7df6c97d20ea2576a2da423a2d152cbb8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e8098485ade315fac23d067dae6bb2555bed59b12413b404f47b76560a992ea2"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 12,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 12,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 12,
      "hexagramName": "否",
      "poemText": "天厭周德，命與南國。以禮靜民，兵革休息。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5f911a7ab0f0c1343e9f7373509f000f1c2175e59f710c1cc23828ed231122dd",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0862ff1986db28f6eb52a31d66ef11e8b2f61cca9e9e89bd63aeb2120ce24f66"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 13,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 13,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 13,
      "hexagramName": "同人",
      "poemText": "壅遏隄防，水不得行。火光盛陽，陰魄伏匿。走歸其鄉。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e9eb7094c5c4ab12c6137f5a1f8317b6b6d5bc78dcdfc3f58a58c0b51e31f5a8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:993f5bbd171a2b949c1ba12499a9438d915fa89fa372c84f13edbcad872ba263"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 14,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 14,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 14,
      "hexagramName": "大有",
      "poemText": "河海都市，國之奧府。商人受福，少子玉石。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4a53ea29652d5f99e842d99ad5f3dc100862fb48bc8d4d81a97bd6e134eae942",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1f70cae6bde3dde629a2b15bc9b8e098445614a261e824cdc44352c1ee1fabc7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 15,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 15,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 15,
      "hexagramName": "謙",
      "poemText": "東行避兵，南去不祥。西逐凶惡，北 福生。與喜相逢。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6cef52f1ea7b8b69dd3e3ee646dc290c828ac30769342c4dc59ee5d3bf3497da",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:bd3d27fbb2a35e159c75f80ff647cce5d200d7c2eb19587eaac6820da135e99d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 16,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 16,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 16,
      "hexagramName": "豫",
      "poemText": "東家中女，嫫母最醜。三十無室，媒伯勞苦。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7df94d63237d698687e4484a656f530192a98e36d394131dfa5d00728b7da3f9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3ceaa82a1f399f6ee63cbcdf7b81d342876e183a4d4e8fcacbbc69ae2043cf35"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 17,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 17,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 17,
      "hexagramName": "隨",
      "poemText": "破亡之國，天所不福，難以止息。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:bc3fbc1df41787e7f18c289cf9127452f1b1fbc36da7d980c37ea24fe43dd35d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:bf1c42141859602b327b66329d94857a3cf382f3cb47afcae9ceb7864f4dcabd"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 18,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 18,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 18,
      "hexagramName": "蠱",
      "poemText": "驂駕蹇驢，日暮失時。居者無憂，保我樂娛。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5d76d14f6784c4665cf0098c1b1ccc38fa61a151d17e6447b13846fa04265693",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7b00af088266ac81d2a97ff6b8e26940c9d7e2d62216f7b10395b5962365dc68"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 19,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 19,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 19,
      "hexagramName": "臨",
      "poemText": "蝃蝀之側，佞幸傾惑。女謁橫行，王道充塞。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6c832748b347e1bcad004f26d87d42dc78b698a15badd4700119cc7faeb916fa",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:14be48a3345e077996d28a8881fff568f0146d6a21ca2660480c8cc05df74661"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 20,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 20,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 20,
      "hexagramName": "觀",
      "poemText": "三羖五羊，相隨並行。迷入空澤，有谷直北。徑涉六駁，為所傷賊。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8a588ca3d9d817a7667663014ce22acfbd6909f60ee338c21ea4c5e708a08d0b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:69560b97021ee61a77ec3c10e92d4d12658b40d9de1bcc16fefa8ed8978c3f15"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 21,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 21,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 21,
      "hexagramName": "噬嗑",
      "poemText": "戴喜抱子，與利為友。天之所命，不憂危殆。荀伯勞苦，西來王母。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:56c2db9aafff396060be93c274d12d6a0f3465aff0cd2552922d220ab8432a03",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:86bea12cd10ba9ddd8fdc84ce6554254bdbf8e766e4942b71a09238151525179"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 22,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 22,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 22,
      "hexagramName": "賁",
      "poemText": "織縷未就，針折不復。女工多態，亂我政事。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d39b0f9b9d51eba010976b14609f44a462c35f0273e2f7f7b7ff5e608e151933",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:dbf5ade9ccfdab1bfa4620e8020b334aa334c734e2aee6309773011d5e00f6f6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 23,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 23,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 23,
      "hexagramName": "剝",
      "poemText": "行露之訟，貞女不行。君子無食，使道壅塞。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:aeb55dea7d4f8fe3dc29c29a381683d22c11602b669573f107599d732d4784fd",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:aa97345e1f1c6fa6daf840a7c4cf189d1dc5f83649532c91deceb3b89b71985d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 24,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 24,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 24,
      "hexagramName": "復",
      "poemText": "羿張烏號，彀射天狼。鐘鼓不鳴，將軍振攘。趙國雄勇，鬥死滎陽。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d438b509a5ce5526e067c19c527efb34c88468377bbca981b9585aefdb8f59e4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:77a6099a8465f3f1f53b7f576032fe2c45eaa2eddee82d66c0204c267585255f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 26,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 26,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 26,
      "hexagramName": "大畜",
      "poemText": "延頸望酒，不入我口。商人勞苦，利得無有。夏臺羑里，難為復喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:175a45ef4077ac9b3bc6ecbd42fc98d617bb7771accb34fef9fb8e52a6995f96",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:864610e192002768cc2f58c615e459869dca8ca00aad624b34ec3b09ff35ea11"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 27,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 27,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 27,
      "hexagramName": "頤",
      "poemText": "冠帶南遊，與喜相期。邀於嘉國，拜位逢時。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:37a4926e571e87b7103ab8f9edd5d59b6cd1cb595efb9967e4714da244a41843",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:fb95969459e01c1fc8c838384b8e3a78ef14b3933bd30340ec944588796b1ad9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 28,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 28,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 28,
      "hexagramName": "大過",
      "poemText": "東西觸垣，不利出門。魚藏深水，無以樂賓。爵級摧頹，光威咸衰。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1f320598a1cc70eb155c896d36396e4f0a9b1d63b9ec0c9bc2b47d0380bc0726",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:656827cb2b055df8d26980ec70924f8711f16f3235526e08a42a2abf884cc13c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 29,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 29,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 29,
      "hexagramName": "坎",
      "poemText": "兩母千子，轉息無已。五乳百雛，騂駁驤駒。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ee6757af1cac7883cb8aa0f670b53c21e9c6f79dd9afeff90b5502b5c5d2ad08",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5f2a880a55493f416ce06b491757cd91b0512629e255254ad3c5ef6c09c3dfde"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 30,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 30,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 30,
      "hexagramName": "離",
      "poemText": "重 祖後，司馬太史。陽氏之災，雕宮悲苦。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c0bb77e0d350eab621216fed9137789774177a586618a8de0b2f1af3ebcc2c21",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:eea5fb5e80c6f68efbed317f3edb75a4d5f2e11e407fbcfb591c781d8a29cf87"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 31,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 31,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 31,
      "hexagramName": "咸",
      "poemText": "內執柔德，止訟以默。宗邑賴福，禍災不作。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2b9cbbeb92fa995d5db38ab9a3159eeb0ef452a888c8ac42103b7e7fac2ade39",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:976f437b7ebe355833f03c3710f5f26ffa916f7d508eded5ee1cf38da22fb993"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 32,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 32,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 32,
      "hexagramName": "恒",
      "poemText": "采唐沬鄉，邀期桑中。失信不會，憂思約帶。巽之乾，師之噬嗑。（一作牛驥同堂，郭氏以亡。國破為墟，君奔走逃。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9809b1ea95479427bd6e19078af4fd7b9c84f5b96dc7210df8d25dc3b2362328",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d30320dc7f96559f750fa4eeb63b30eef63b22030c2b897532cc74902e59640e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 33,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 33,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 33,
      "hexagramName": "遯",
      "poemText": "官成立政，衣就缺袂。恭謙為衛，終無禍尤。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:dd3f491b1b45421c0bb656819a5bfb5eb16d3ef7f7b99503092dc9bd0b6cf1ef",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a9280cde3c29139c9f12b0f5af1cc1bec694e8cf1f9195d8b64906bf5358df77"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 34,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 34,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 34,
      "hexagramName": "大壯",
      "poemText": "麒麟鳳凰，子孫盛昌。少齊在門，利以合婚。貴人大歡。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:881359969831e6a2162622e9356e866ba7da3c4500b5d6ef32b7ab49c960bc93",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4a18bdff2cd1eb05db1494c2853d7a748f9c92831f47048f82def9c401f56d6b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 35,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 35,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 35,
      "hexagramName": "晉",
      "poemText": "亂危之國，不可涉域。機機發發，身頓僵覆。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a22f6d8d6468e29d23af710f2c44279a2c0fec7303ee4b92f54690379b0e284a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c4a429b749b4021f5f4570ece9d388146cd885196add9b64489d7d89bcfd36cd"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 36,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 36,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 36,
      "hexagramName": "明夷",
      "poemText": "千雀萬鳩，與鷂為仇。威勢不敵，雖眾無益。為鷹所擊，萬事皆失。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4cf440c91dd5515635c21c95f0613018eb994109026939833e7b4abf372d7a2b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d76bae0edcb895800b501887deaa07c342d9d6bebc7166829bbfe5d03831e96a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 37,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 37,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 37,
      "hexagramName": "家人",
      "poemText": "眾神集聚，相與議語。南國虐亂，百姓愁苦。興師征討，更立賢主。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b5357434bc7ed2bc7ed63c6b626a5eaf16180cfcfa382f00aedd7a1f9298edf6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6fe7cb360cf9c59ba95b8e4d85b80b309be539e4f164fe05ca88c4afaa8384d5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 38,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 38,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 38,
      "hexagramName": "睽",
      "poemText": "顏淵閔騫，以禮自閑。君子所居，禍災不存。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d4dca6b4d95736c117f732aaa425ad09613022dee3da095ad6792ee0ace34e84",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7d01b1e2c8cb8944c174e841cf1346ce1b6b508b6ceae19a76bf7460ae45a84e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 39,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 39,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 39,
      "hexagramName": "蹇",
      "poemText": "三桓子孫，世秉國權。爵勢上卿，富於周公。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:76ea4f84c24056a77a0a63520fe6bd0e09b6016aace3409be2e324c99324eaa2",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e9ddddaa5215123f7cb0ce212db3d4dcb4fc78bb54e46bad9101453bff0959a7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 40,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 40,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 40,
      "hexagramName": "解",
      "poemText": "鶴鳴九皋，處子失時。載土販鹽，難為功力。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:16504971c6bf7dfa78c7bab42c5387b659a458ffc6fbcbd48698e007ed89e1f6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b00358898926c4bc4f71ae802af3d9570de14bd256031909447fe23b97ec083e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 41,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 41,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 41,
      "hexagramName": "損",
      "poemText": "方軸圓輪，車行不前。組囊以錐，失其事便。還師振旅，兵革休止。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ff29dc05e5ec8fca72285287b23b793ff91fdfb1a082a075a4f7b30c875b0ade",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a8f57a62f5d094a43d04a4de0655ac3b7b28946803688644ddeb3a87c4a4d45c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 42,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 42,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 42,
      "hexagramName": "益",
      "poemText": "魚擾水濁，桀亂我國。駕龍出遊，東之樂邑。天賜我祿，與生為福。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1cf56a5d0d9e0ded04ff158db937fc5fd1767ed4734f87ca41d38b5b7371d046",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:eaff54e65280b3516e0bbd90eb593d46957c8a25b4e376e94cfea0938edf9552"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 43,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 43,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 43,
      "hexagramName": "夬",
      "poemText": "白虎黑狼，伏伺山陽。遮遏牛羊，病我商人。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:568758950dc3074f2b058899446545219f9c2e8cdea07d33ea49c7ecc25898b1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:40f3c24abcb392cb2390e0af28df5d82b04408acc9411335df020274eff497e9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 44,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 44,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 44,
      "hexagramName": "姤",
      "poemText": "履危不安，疏顛我顏，傷腫為瘢。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:51cf5f25a6ecc1c561a7c22e5df4639694f7d9a36aab4ff935fa2cb6f5d57531",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:60f3d679a95c9dbe8f34adc3de111c3d9f5de36fefe234fbd8c17b5b8dbacc91"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 45,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 45,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 45,
      "hexagramName": "萃",
      "poemText": "三人輦車，東入旁家。主母貪饕，盜我資財。亡失犁牛。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d46029c3178edf858eb4dd5b5837b5b3b299ae5a460388dca5f563b6b25017bb",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1165dcd02e383ed865df416205f4b3230c6d6c9fba50118eb656fdd291cfc945"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 46,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 46,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 46,
      "hexagramName": "升",
      "poemText": "三鶴南飛，俱就塘池。蝦 饒有，利得過倍。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3d6e4862a5e9b64823c986843917e7db81c84a5e364c64c40864c4ec4ffda103",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:74aa88180e4b3c5c07bcf90b774f325a06307c84755472a0d473f3e97e89d641"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 47,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 47,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 47,
      "hexagramName": "困",
      "poemText": "鷹栖茂樹，候雀往來。一擊獲兩，利在枝柯。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b443e16ae1ba8ce7c652a86e4d9672322a500f397fe2863e09641d586dd186a3",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:698ffc304443ba91bc4a01141b85f05b2131edef96350771a7b2268a2f3038ac"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 48,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 48,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 48,
      "hexagramName": "井",
      "poemText": "堯舜欽明，禹稷股肱。伊尹往來，進履登堂。顯德之徒，可以輔王。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8e43307f5a6581ac0f83ebeb028589ab437f6febf4213cda2622cb1129cd49c7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9c72a9bf913984b7ced8531bc7b1afbf5bd9b72c13ae790359accef04347e97b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 49,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 49,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 49,
      "hexagramName": "革",
      "poemText": "枯旱三年，草萊不生。粢盛空乏，無以供靈。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:fc2d44d74fae17c0cf23bfde336c1fc35aea1b17dd808238ccd37d35b869137c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a1bb27e6f682880fd033e33056c577b2d2932e5f077a5d2f234e52d0c30de6e8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 50,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 50,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 50,
      "hexagramName": "鼎",
      "poemText": "方口圓舌，為知樞門。解釋鉤帶，商旅以歡。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3c69d16ef3e101cd3eec80e721827995fd0ae41fec5f3947d4030bee9bd17cfc",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:be9b9b67ab0213fb5860d804aadf866843964945cfd708ce686e9d16defd6233"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 51,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 51,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 51,
      "hexagramName": "震",
      "poemText": "鳧池水溢，高陸為海。江河橫流，魚鱉成市。千里無牆，鴛鳳游行。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:778325a394442776443746dbd1b817ddda8ab9968b7095f7162de8a4fab853f4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:cb892c78f611d44cdf9b186f74519a06aa7e68bb1a7bd6ba71f34447013e83fc"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 52,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 52,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 52,
      "hexagramName": "艮",
      "poemText": "烹魚失刀，駕車馬亡。錫刃不入，魴鯉腥臊。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6080b3371df2c9cd85de6a6759f0b75528400a7a5ab5ec174bff594c66e95fa0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:16e28d1efa28a16f6031c801b2ff07fa141f2a009067f94ca2cd164dffc3d915"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 53,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 53,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 53,
      "hexagramName": "漸",
      "poemText": "戎狄蹲踞，無禮貪饕。非吾族類，君子攸去。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ee6fc8507d270d5435092dafb4839eeadccfa3216a99c1bb0b579592007422d8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8f7af9a51d426efedae21a80817de6dc3cec41731d83e8d6ed3624ff5e690571"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 54,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 54,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 54,
      "hexagramName": "歸妹",
      "poemText": "渡河踰水，狐濡其尾。不為禍憂，捕魚遇蟹。利得無幾。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:25008795f99e94ce1b9f583482fd052f2c5b26568db8193bb7b3930ecf41b3a1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7c77c7d17b7179c329f7c93e96ca8004df84598b11f3326f2a9d8a427aef34a5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 55,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 55,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 55,
      "hexagramName": "豐",
      "poemText": "河出小魚，不宜勞煩。苛政害民，君受其患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1dbd06dbae9f3b75802c331616e73dbc47c1dd76d5523b726ea6a89f2acc21ee",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7db82ee582ea3934f6bc67422436f99dc49888f072c590c89ad564dc215f2d14"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 56,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 56,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 56,
      "hexagramName": "旅",
      "poemText": "偃武修文，兵革休安。清人逍遙，來歸空閒。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9351af7d7649195c47b116ae92ef20322f5a5b4c29fff2afa75dedb1e87ada3a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a23099f947dca719dd850b3277d02ef5996f208b70a9c9586f63a9f9796bd585"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 57,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 57,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 57,
      "hexagramName": "巽",
      "poemText": "九疑鬱林，沮濕不中。鸞鳥易去，君子不安。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4676cde95351690b6883408fccf90bc10c3f0d68bbd299e47f6b4a51eba7f2ac",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:46999cd384941d75ea96934339dd75c2425bb64abede64277345978be4b3a246"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 58,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 58,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 58,
      "hexagramName": "兌",
      "poemText": "搏 逢虎，患厭不起。遂至懽國，與福笑語。君子樂喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:70879489443bd38ff9e7a2f807b79b345fe1676d2870604fb2aac900de293d74",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:67067371ea89a7d027ae80d5dd1e15817f0f6f23872cf202ac5b727efeba73c1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 59,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 59,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 59,
      "hexagramName": "渙",
      "poemText": "狗生龍馬，公勞嫗苦。家無筐筥，折悔為吝。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:735134cbe22f97ea4770664866cd7647147de292c6d56069835ff97d182574ee",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7c45964fd3ed93e5b8996f71ac2482abaa8b9450f776cb2e5a2dc47758e394e9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 60,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 60,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 60,
      "hexagramName": "節",
      "poemText": "嬰孩求乳，慈母歸子。黃麑悅喜，得其甘餌。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4dd6732c0d60491b45213bdd249e02b6319a1fd4a4fa84181a98964f31ae1616",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0a8fed79a8342a10e86cec810151caf487e81521d1707006937df5dda6d40ac8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 61,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 61,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 61,
      "hexagramName": "中孚",
      "poemText": "有兩赤鷂，從五隼噪。操矢無筈，趣釋爾射。扶伏聽命，不敢動搖。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e29e141be6d9ef21d29efe8c87189509da6d13c2e2412b3e13ca585d62942afd",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7d5dccca6ec382e8362bc36e0d8565e1f00792e37aeff9a1e64fe6eea425ff84"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 62,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 62,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 62,
      "hexagramName": "小過",
      "poemText": "伊尹智士，去桀耕野。執順以強，天祐無咎。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4d251c5d89262cf2e6d8c4b161a3a759b15c0bb1eda9eecbb8b6b90a78af58df",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:103553ce9498d15753dcba4a2975f0748b6cf601892b8cd738948c708323a228"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 63,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 63,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 63,
      "hexagramName": "既濟",
      "poemText": "逐鹿山西，利入我門。陰陽和調，國無災殃。長子東遊，須其三仇。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e8ca74f53540f6288f1f54d369308560c6445040ef2fa7f290e9f9f494e4c7c6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d87670b1fe301d4f2e270f70ef02d55356dda54a621205b6960e31f097783390"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 25,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 64,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 64,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 64,
      "hexagramName": "未濟",
      "poemText": "龍興之德，周武成福。長女宜家，與君相德。長股遠行，狸且善藏。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d6fc7fd443ebfa2e03a5a06af531b86c138c3dd60935fa35fa9ffaed6b24bb3a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0fe734fc669d5e93cd56673b56263a8d7c5a83d008672711d1c04656991428e6"
    }
  ]
}
